IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `aia-core`
IMPORT `aia-timeline`
IMPORT `P9-gate`
IMPORT `P9-art-80`

-- Tests for Article 80. Expected values are written from the text of Article 80 and Article 113 (the General group applies
-- from 2 August 2026) and Article 111(2) (a high-risk AI system placed on the market before the date of application of
-- Chapter III is saved unless it is significantly changed in its design), never copied from the encoding's own output.
-- args (every function): the date asked, the AI system, then the facts in the order of the function's GIVEN.

§ `The AI systems the tests use`

-- Annex III route, placed after the Chapter III date (2 December 2027): not saved by Article 111(2).
`the new Annex III system` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 1 1 2030
    `route` IS `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS FALSE

-- Annex III route, placed on 1 January 2027 (before 2 December 2027), not significantly changed: saved by Article 111(2).
`the legacy Annex III system` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 1 1 2027
    `route` IS `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS FALSE

-- The same legacy system after a significant change in its design: not saved.
`the changed legacy Annex III system` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 1 1 2027
    `route` IS `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS TRUE

-- A system that is not high-risk: Article 111(2) saves operators of high-risk AI systems only.
`the system that is not high-risk` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 1 1 2020
    `route` IS `Route neither`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS FALSE

§ `Article 80(1)`

-- args: date asked, system, classified as non-high-risk under Article 6(3), authority has sufficient reason to consider it indeed high-risk
-- Before 2 August 2026 the group does not apply: NOTHING (on each side of 27 July 2026, the date of the Omnibus: Article 80 is the same text).
#ASSERT `Art 80(1) the market surveillance authority must carry out an evaluation of the classification` (Date 26 7 2026) `the new Annex III system` TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 80(1) the market surveillance authority must carry out an evaluation of the classification` (Date 27 7 2026) `the new Annex III system` TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 80(1) the market surveillance authority must carry out an evaluation of the classification` (Date 1 8 2026) `the new Annex III system` TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- On 2 August 2026 and after: both facts hold, the authority must evaluate.
#ASSERT `Art 80(1) the market surveillance authority must carry out an evaluation of the classification` (Date 2 8 2026) `the new Annex III system` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 80(1) the market surveillance authority must carry out an evaluation of the classification` (Date 3 8 2026) `the new Annex III system` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Without sufficient reason: the "Where" condition is not met.
#ASSERT `Art 80(1) the market surveillance authority must carry out an evaluation of the classification` (Date 2 8 2026) `the new Annex III system` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Not classified by the provider as non-high-risk pursuant to Article 6(3): the paragraph does not speak to the case.
#ASSERT `Art 80(1) the market surveillance authority must carry out an evaluation of the classification` (Date 2 8 2026) `the new Annex III system` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Article 111(2): a legacy high-risk system is saved (NOTHING); changed in its design it is covered; a system that is not high-risk is never saved.
#ASSERT `Art 80(1) the market surveillance authority must carry out an evaluation of the classification` (Date 2 8 2028) `the legacy Annex III system` TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 80(1) the market surveillance authority must carry out an evaluation of the classification` (Date 2 8 2028) `the changed legacy Annex III system` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 80(1) the market surveillance authority must carry out an evaluation of the classification` (Date 2 8 2026) `the system that is not high-risk` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE

§ `Article 80(2)`

-- args: date asked, system, evaluation under Article 80(1) is being carried out, authority finds the AI system high-risk
#ASSERT `Art 80(2) the market surveillance authority must require the provider to take all necessary actions and appropriate corrective action` (Date 1 8 2026) `the new Annex III system` TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 80(2) the market surveillance authority must require the provider to take all necessary actions and appropriate corrective action` (Date 2 8 2026) `the new Annex III system` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 80(2) the market surveillance authority must require the provider to take all necessary actions and appropriate corrective action` (Date 2 8 2026) `the new Annex III system` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 80(2) the market surveillance authority must require the provider to take all necessary actions and appropriate corrective action` (Date 2 8 2026) `the new Annex III system` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 80(2) the market surveillance authority must require the provider to take all necessary actions and appropriate corrective action` (Date 2 8 2028) `the legacy Annex III system` TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Article 80(3)`

-- args: date asked, system, authority considers that the use of the AI system is not restricted to its national territory
#ASSERT `Art 80(3) the market surveillance authority must inform the Commission and the other Member States` (Date 1 8 2026) `the new Annex III system` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 80(3) the market surveillance authority must inform the Commission and the other Member States` (Date 2 8 2026) `the new Annex III system` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 80(3) the market surveillance authority must inform the Commission and the other Member States` (Date 2 8 2026) `the new Annex III system` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 80(3) the market surveillance authority must inform the Commission and the other Member States` (Date 2 8 2028) `the legacy Annex III system` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Article 80(4)`

-- args: date asked, system, authority has required the provider to act under Article 80(2), provider brought the system into compliance within the period
#ASSERT `Art 80(4) the provider is subject to fines in accordance with Article 99` (Date 1 8 2026) `the new Annex III system` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 80(4) the provider is subject to fines in accordance with Article 99` (Date 2 8 2026) `the new Annex III system` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 80(4) the provider is subject to fines in accordance with Article 99` (Date 2 8 2026) `the new Annex III system` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- No requirement under paragraph 2: there is no "period referred to in paragraph 2".
#ASSERT `Art 80(4) the provider is subject to fines in accordance with Article 99` (Date 2 8 2026) `the new Annex III system` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 80(4) the provider is subject to fines in accordance with Article 99` (Date 2 8 2028) `the legacy Annex III system` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

-- The provider's duty with its period: required on 1 September 2026, period ends on 1 October 2026 (30 days).
-- args: date asked, system, required, day the period began, day it ends
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 80(4) the duty of the provider to bring the AI system into compliance` (Date 2 9 2026) `the new Annex III system` TRUE (Date 1 9 2026) (Date 1 10 2026) AT (Day (Date 1 9 2026)) WITH
    PARTY `Art 80 the provider` DOES `Art 80(4) ensure that all necessary action is taken to bring the AI system into compliance` AT (Day (Date 1 10 2026))
-- Done one day late: BREACH.
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `Art 80(4) the duty of the provider to bring the AI system into compliance` (Date 2 9 2026) `the new Annex III system` TRUE (Date 1 9 2026) (Date 1 10 2026) AT (Day (Date 1 9 2026)) WITH
    PARTY `Art 80 the provider` DOES `Art 80(4) ensure that all necessary action is taken to bring the AI system into compliance` AT (Day (Date 2 10 2026))
-- Never done: BREACH once the period has passed.
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `Art 80(4) the duty of the provider to bring the AI system into compliance` (Date 2 9 2026) `the new Annex III system` TRUE (Date 1 9 2026) (Date 1 10 2026) AT (Day (Date 1 9 2026)) WITH
    WAITUNTIL (Day (Date 2 10 2026))
-- Authority has not required action: nothing is owed.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 80(4) the duty of the provider to bring the AI system into compliance` (Date 2 9 2026) `the new Annex III system` FALSE (Date 1 9 2026) (Date 1 10 2026) AT (Day (Date 1 9 2026)) WITH
    WAITUNTIL (Day (Date 2 10 2026))
-- Before the group applies (1 August 2026): nothing is owed.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 80(4) the duty of the provider to bring the AI system into compliance` (Date 1 8 2026) `the new Annex III system` TRUE (Date 1 9 2026) (Date 1 10 2026) AT (Day (Date 1 9 2026)) WITH
    WAITUNTIL (Day (Date 2 10 2026))
-- A legacy system saved by Article 111(2): nothing is owed; changed in its design it is: BREACH.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 80(4) the duty of the provider to bring the AI system into compliance` (Date 2 9 2028) `the legacy Annex III system` TRUE (Date 1 9 2028) (Date 1 10 2028) AT (Day (Date 1 9 2028)) WITH
    WAITUNTIL (Day (Date 2 10 2028))
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `Art 80(4) the duty of the provider to bring the AI system into compliance` (Date 2 9 2028) `the changed legacy Annex III system` TRUE (Date 1 9 2028) (Date 1 10 2028) AT (Day (Date 1 9 2028)) WITH
    WAITUNTIL (Day (Date 2 10 2028))

§ `Article 80(5)`

-- args: date asked, system, authority has required the provider to act under Article 80(2), number of AI systems concerned made available on the Union market, number with appropriate corrective action taken
#ASSERT `Art 80(5) the provider has ensured that all appropriate corrective action is taken` (Date 1 8 2026) `the new Annex III system` TRUE 3 3 EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 80(5) the provider has ensured that all appropriate corrective action is taken` (Date 2 8 2026) `the new Annex III system` TRUE 3 3 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 80(5) the provider has ensured that all appropriate corrective action is taken` (Date 2 8 2026) `the new Annex III system` TRUE 3 2 EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 80(5) the provider has ensured that all appropriate corrective action is taken` (Date 2 8 2026) `the new Annex III system` TRUE 0 0 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 80(5) the provider has ensured that all appropriate corrective action is taken` (Date 2 8 2026) `the new Annex III system` FALSE 3 2 EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 80(5) the provider has ensured that all appropriate corrective action is taken` (Date 2 8 2028) `the legacy Annex III system` TRUE 3 3 EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Article 80(6)`

-- args: date asked, system, authority has required the provider to act, provider took adequate corrective action within the period
#ASSERT `Art 80(6) Article 79(5) to (9) apply to the AI system` (Date 1 8 2026) `the new Annex III system` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 80(6) Article 79(5) to (9) apply to the AI system` (Date 2 8 2026) `the new Annex III system` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 80(6) Article 79(5) to (9) apply to the AI system` (Date 2 8 2026) `the new Annex III system` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 80(6) Article 79(5) to (9) apply to the AI system` (Date 2 8 2026) `the new Annex III system` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 80(6) Article 79(5) to (9) apply to the AI system` (Date 2 8 2028) `the legacy Annex III system` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Article 80(7)`

-- args: date asked, system, evaluation under paragraph 1 is being carried out, authority establishes misclassification, misclassified in order to circumvent Chapter III Section 2
#ASSERT `Art 80(7) the provider is subject to fines in accordance with Article 99 for misclassification` (Date 1 8 2026) `the new Annex III system` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 80(7) the provider is subject to fines in accordance with Article 99 for misclassification` (Date 2 8 2026) `the new Annex III system` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Each element missing, in turn.
#ASSERT `Art 80(7) the provider is subject to fines in accordance with Article 99 for misclassification` (Date 2 8 2026) `the new Annex III system` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 80(7) the provider is subject to fines in accordance with Article 99 for misclassification` (Date 2 8 2026) `the new Annex III system` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 80(7) the provider is subject to fines in accordance with Article 99 for misclassification` (Date 2 8 2026) `the new Annex III system` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 80(7) the provider is subject to fines in accordance with Article 99 for misclassification` (Date 2 8 2028) `the legacy Annex III system` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Article 80(8)`

-- args: date asked, system, authority is exercising its power to monitor the application of Article 80, the checks are in accordance with Article 11 of Regulation (EU) 2019/1020
#ASSERT `Art 80(8) the market surveillance authority may perform appropriate checks` (Date 1 8 2026) `the new Annex III system` TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 80(8) the market surveillance authority may perform appropriate checks` (Date 2 8 2026) `the new Annex III system` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- A grant limited by its own wording: outside the limit the answer is NOTHING, not JUST FALSE.
#ASSERT `Art 80(8) the market surveillance authority may perform appropriate checks` (Date 2 8 2026) `the new Annex III system` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 80(8) the market surveillance authority may perform appropriate checks` (Date 2 8 2026) `the new Annex III system` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `The regulative rules without a time limit: the act done is FULFILLED, and nothing owed is FULFILLED (no breach path: no stated deadline or consequence)`

-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 80(1) the duty of the market surveillance authority to evaluate the classification` (Date 2 8 2026) `the new Annex III system` TRUE TRUE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `Art 80 the market surveillance authority` DOES `Art 80(1) carry out an evaluation of the AI system in respect of its classification as a high-risk AI system` AT 5
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 80(1) the duty of the market surveillance authority to evaluate the classification` (Date 1 8 2026) `the new Annex III system` TRUE TRUE AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 400
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 80(2) the duty of the market surveillance authority to require the provider to act` (Date 2 8 2026) `the new Annex III system` TRUE TRUE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `Art 80 the market surveillance authority` DOES `Art 80(2) require the provider to take all necessary actions and appropriate corrective action` AT 5
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 80(3) the duty of the market surveillance authority to inform the Commission and the other Member States` (Date 2 8 2026) `the new Annex III system` TRUE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `Art 80 the market surveillance authority` DOES `Art 80(3) inform the Commission and the other Member States of the results of the evaluation and of the actions required of the provider` AT 5
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 80(5) the duty of the provider to ensure corrective action in respect of all the AI systems concerned` (Date 2 8 2026) `the new Annex III system` TRUE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `Art 80 the provider` DOES `Art 80(5) ensure that all appropriate corrective action is taken in respect of all the AI systems concerned` AT 5
